@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@productId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Listado paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&per_page=10
Accept: application/json

### Crear y copiar data.id a productId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"name":"Teclado","description":"USB","price_cents":2599,"stock":3}

### Consultar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar parcialmente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"stock":0,"description":null}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### Ejemplo de validación (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"name":"","price_cents":-1}
